  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At a Thieving Heaven inheritance entrance he tells Zhao Lian Yun she can be the next generation fairy of Spirit Affinity House if she obtains the inheritance. Illusory Fairy Li Jun Ying, his wife, stands beside him. The couple are the most important people in the anti-Feng faction inside the House. He wants formless hand and still resents defeat by Feng Jiu Ge, and treats Zhao Lian Yun as a tool in that power struggle.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "char_li_jun_ying",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "News that Feng Jiu Ge survived leaves Xu Hao and Li Jun Ying feeling heavy, and they say the coming period will be difficult for them. The couple had intentionally delayed and hidden news of Zhao Lian Yun’s rise, and even if Feng Jiu Ge cannot use it against them, he will be displeased with them and would naturally suppress them to some extent when he returns.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-fallout",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge and Fairy Bai Qing name Xu Hao and Li Jun Ying as the people guiding Zhao Lian Yun, and Feng Jiu Ge says Xu Hao probably instigated her kneeling. Xu Hao is trying to make Zhao Lian Yun defeat Feng Jin Huang and become the fairy of Spirit Affinity House, so that he can use her power to ally with others and oppose Feng Jiu Ge. Feng Jiu Ge’s return had put the couple at a disadvantage, but using Zhao Lian Yun’s influence they hold their ground and are untouchable by even Feng Jiu Ge inside Spirit Affinity House.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-the-fairy-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_qing",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When love Gu acknowledges Zhao Lian Yun, he speaks before gathered Spirit Affinity House immortals and declares that by the sect’s rules she is the current generation fairy. Intense joy shows beneath his expressionless tone as he sees a chance to retaliate against the Feng faction.",
      "chapters": [
        1222
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "love-gu-announcement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_love_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
